px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;,   0,   0,   0,   0,   0,   0,   0,   0],dtype=torch.int32)，【实际过程中，这些 “0” 未必是0，可能是上次未赋值的数】&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- accept_index=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;tensor([[ 0, 2, -1, -1]], dtype=torch.int32)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-size: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-size: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- accept_length=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;tensor([1], dtype=torch.int32)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;---&amp;gt; sql_kernel,,, &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;判断是否结束，然后整理kv cache，并且为下一次前向计算准备 EagleDraftInput&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
