        <mxCell id="T8o65e2Chz1gluBfnjVN-245" value="&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;target_worker.model_runner.attn_backend.init_forward_metadata 【===&amp;gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;初始化或者更新forward metadata&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px; white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;】&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 24px; white-space: pre; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;----&amp;gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;self.indices_updater_prefill.update() &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;【===&amp;gt; 注意，这个&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;FlashInferIndicesUpdaterPrefill类的update方法，虽然没有实现，但是在 __init__() 方法中有绑定逻辑】&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt